caption: Advantages and Permissions
tradition-component: advantages-and-permissions

The two fixed 5-point Revelator Talents may be purchased up to level 4 through Revelator.

Abilities belonging solely to either Revelator Power have Basic purchase access before Mastery, subject to the Basic cap treatment above.

Qualifying Conjunction Abilities have Advanced purchase access before Mastery.

The character retains normal access to Eldritch Reserve and Eldritch Universal Traits under the Domain Core.

Revelator grants no third fixed Talent, Universal Talent, Expanded Core, Modular Ability, or free character points.
